# Linux patch series for libplacebo, applied by platforms/linux/build.sh to the
# pin in overrides.linux. One pool filename per line; order is authoritative.
#
# Shared with series.android (see there for why this is not series.common).
# Linux enables Vulkan for the separate PME compute device and keeps the
# Wayland display plane on libmpv's existing EGL/OpenGL renderer. On a GLES
# context -- the aarch64 boards whose EGL offers no desktop GL -- this patch is
# the only way an array too large for plain uniforms reaches the shader at all;
# desktop GL rendering is unchanged.
0002-opengl-enable-ubos-on-gles.patch
